WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:02.981
The (bleep) is this?

00:00:02.981 --> 00:00:05.564
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.744 --> 00:00:16.382
Um, it looks like raw beef.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:18.013
The coloring is kinda off.

00:00:18.013 --> 00:00:20.576
It's a little bit darker than I'd expect.

00:00:20.576 --> 00:00:21.880
It looks like someone took tuna,

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.907
smashed it up, and then
laid it across rice.

00:00:24.907 --> 00:00:26.575
I don't see how you can make tuna vegan,

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:27.998
so I don't trust it.

00:00:27.998 --> 00:00:28.831
Why am I nervous?

00:00:28.831 --> 00:00:29.664
Okay.

00:00:31.526 --> 00:00:32.359
Hmm.

00:00:34.737 --> 00:00:35.921
What?

00:00:35.921 --> 00:00:37.140
That is weird.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.849
Oh my God.

00:00:38.849 --> 00:00:39.990
This is vegan?

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.536
That's actually really good.

00:00:41.536 --> 00:00:42.762
Kinda flavorless.

00:00:42.762 --> 00:00:45.453
I don't know if it tastes
like tuna, but it tastes good.

00:00:45.453 --> 00:00:47.365
What is this?
It's tomatoes.

00:00:47.365 --> 00:00:49.970
Oh my what? (laughs)

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:51.520
Wow.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.907
What?

00:00:52.907 --> 00:00:53.887
That makes sense, it kinda looks

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.578
like tomato skin, like inside out.

00:00:56.578 --> 00:01:01.133
It has all the flavors, but
you have none of the texture.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.396
I really like that.

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:03.858
It doesn't taste like tuna at all though,

00:01:03.858 --> 00:01:06.352
it's more like sun-dried tomato.

00:01:06.352 --> 00:01:08.016
Yeah, once I know that it's a tomato,

00:01:08.016 --> 00:01:10.133
I can't not taste the tomato.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:10.966
That makes sense,
(snapping fingers)

00:01:10.966 --> 00:01:14.776
it did taste really tart,
and fruity, like a tomato.

00:01:14.776 --> 00:01:16.368
Zach?

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:17.913
Slide over here.

00:01:17.913 --> 00:01:19.094
Get close to my mic, try this.

00:01:19.094 --> 00:01:21.180
Zach's a big sushi boy.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.439
Like, there's a lot of vegan food

00:01:22.439 --> 00:01:24.803
that is, surprisingly, crazy good,

00:01:24.803 --> 00:01:27.004
and it's just expensive, or hard to find,

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:29.492
but if you told me that I
could eat this every day,

00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:30.758
I'd be like, yeah, I'm fine with that.

00:01:30.758 --> 00:01:32.067
It doesn't look good to me.

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:33.166
(laughs)
What?

00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:35.446
It looks like food.
Hmm.

00:01:35.446 --> 00:01:36.995
Vegans and vegetarians still like

00:01:36.995 --> 00:01:39.927
to eat things that taste good.

00:01:39.927 --> 00:01:42.122
It doesn't matter that it looks like meat,

00:01:42.122 --> 00:01:43.834
it just matters that it's not.

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:46.156
I'm so happy that there is a good,

00:01:46.156 --> 00:01:49.557
legit sushi alternative for vegan people,

00:01:49.557 --> 00:01:53.140
'cause that doesn't
really exist until now.

00:02:04.242 --> 00:02:05.464
(logo whooshes)

00:02:05.464 --> 00:02:06.544
(sign creaks)

